      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHERE'S PADDY (3) clocked a good 17.62 when filling a minor placing over 305m at Mt Gambier last start. In form and looks the one to beat. DREAM ON JUNIOR (4) drew this same box last time when in the minors (22.48) in a Mix 6/7 over 390m at Ballarat. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. INGA NOAH (1) turned in a plain performance last time when sixth at this track over 450m behind Kiwi Fred (26.24) in a Mix 6/7 FIN. Was in the money prior to that. Worth another chance. REALITY QUEEN (6) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a one length second (22.22) in a Mix 6/7 at Ballarat.",
